    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<thought\n>But it's not just a wall. It's like... the actual foundation is gone. I've tried the therapy, the meds, the \"small steps\"... it's like trying to rebuild a house that's already turned to ash. I'm tired of pretending there's something left to save. It just feels like I'm running on empty and there's no way to refill the tank. It's more than just being tired. It feels permanent.",
